  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add broccoli and cook until wilted, about 3 minutes.",
    "Deglaze with red wine, scraping the bottom of the pan to loosen any brown bits.",
    "Stir in water, garlic, salt, pepper, and flour. Bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes or until thickened.",
    "Serve warm as a side dish."
